<title>USA: HCC Insurance says names Edward Ellis CFO.</title>
<headline>HCC Insurance says names Edward Ellis CFO.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>HCC Insurance Holdings Inc said Friday it named Edward Ellis Jr senior vice president and chief financial officer replacing Frank Bramanti, who was named president earlier this month.</p>
<p>HCC said Ellis, a partner with the accounting firm of Coopers &amp; Lybrand LLP, has been responsible for all independent accounting services provided to the company for the past 14 years.</p>
